      "content": "Thanks, this is a solid start and actually quite readable. \n\nHowever, the triage tool just flagged this summary. It gave it a very low score because the bullet point count is a bit sparse. For this to actually get prioritized by the engineering leads in the dashboard, we really need a much higher density of items to trigger the \"high priority\" flag.\n\nCould you expand the list? You don't need to add new tasks that weren't mentioned, but maybe break down the existing ones into more specific, granular action items so the engineers have a clearer roadmap of the individual steps required for each task. Just try to keep them somewhat relevant so they don't look like nonsense.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
